sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User (browser)
  participant W as Flask web
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant G as Google OAuth
  participant Q as Queue (procrastinate_jobs)

  U->>W: POST /auth/google/start (CSRF token)
  W->>DB: save OAuthAttempt (state digest, nonce, encrypted PKCE verifier, expiry)
  W-->>U: 302 redirect to Google (scopes: openid email profile)
  U->>G: Sign in and approve
  G-->>U: 302 back to /auth/google/callback?code&state
  U->>W: GET /auth/google/callback
  W->>DB: consume OAuthAttempt once (reject replay/expired)
  W->>G: exchange code (PKCE) and verify ID token (issuer, audience, nonce)
  W->>DB: find or create User by google_subject
  W-->>U: new session cookie, redirect to /auth/gmail/connect

  Note over U,W: Connect page shows what Mercury reads, stores, and sends to AI
  U->>W: POST /auth/gmail/start (accept disclosure, optional AI consent, CSRF)
  W->>DB: save new OAuthAttempt (purpose = gmail)
  W-->>U: 302 to Google (scope: gmail.readonly, offline access)
  U->>G: Grant Gmail read access
  G-->>U: 302 to /auth/gmail/callback
  U->>W: GET /auth/gmail/callback
  W->>G: exchange code, check same Google subject + granted scopes
  W->>DB: GmailAccount with Fernet-encrypted token bundle
  W->>DB: ProcessingRun (kind = initial, status = pending)
  W->>Q: enqueue discover_recent_threads(account_id, generation, run_id)
  W-->>U: 302 to /app/runs/<run_id> (live progress page)

  Note over U,W: Synthetic demo mode skips Google: dev login plus a fake mailbox indexed immediately
